          <h3 class="post-title">NIUA Godot MCP</h3>
          <p class="post-stack">TypeScript · MCP · Godot 4.6 · Claude, Cursor, Codex</p>
          <p>
            MCP server and a bundled Godot editor addon. Agents create, inspect, run, debug, and export Godot 4.6 games through tools — 182 tools across 12 domains (scene, nodes, scripts, run, resources, debug, systems, workflows). The editor bridge is local HTTP with token auth.
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>run_playtest_evidence</em> is the contract: input, assert, screenshot. The agent checks its own work. Installers ship for Claude, Cursor, and Codex.
          </p>
